OL,3,GNEWSAPolice could have done more before
OL,4,Amurder, inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has found police missed
OL,7,Fopportunities to protect a
OL,8,Fmother-of-three who was murdered and
OL,9,Fwhose body was hidden in a suitcase
OL,10,Finside a wheelie bin.
OL,12,FMatthew Waddell was jailed for a
OL,13,Fminimum of 32 years for killing his
OL,14,Fformer partner Sarah Albone, 38, at her
OL,15,Fhome in Biggleswade, Bedfordshire.
OL,17,FAt an inquest into Albone's death, Emma
OL,18,FWhitting, senior coroner for
OL,19,FBedfordshire and Luton, concluded it
OL,20,Fwas an unlawful killing to which
OL,21,FBedfordshire Police failures materially
OL,22,Fcontributed.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
